Specifically, for each month the figure for BEV will be divided by the figure for Total LDV, as shown in [this spreadsheet](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1wc76loC5c06K0gB9GAOK9R47rhlLwBFgxAI88YEZHko/edit?gid=2032607654#gid=2032607654).&#x20;

If Argonne National Laboratory ceases to timely update its data, Admins may name a different resolution source, as long as its methodology and numbers are substantially similar.

Please note that Battery Electric Vehicles (BEV) are a separate category from Plug-in Hybrid Electric Vehicles (PHEV) or Hybrid Electric Vehicles (HEV). This question specifically excludes the hybrids and is asking only about BEV as a percentage of total light-duty vehicle sales.
